          "language": "en",
          "quote": "Logical Query Processing Order A useful conceptual order is: FROM / JOIN → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → SELECT → DISTINCT → ORDER BY → LIMIT/OFFSET Window functions are evaluated after the grouped result exists, which is why they can use aggregate results but generally cannot be used directly in WHERE .",
